# Normalise ordinary text files to LF in the repository.
* text=auto
*.png binary
*.gz binary

# The model files are verified against a SHA-256 manifest of their exact bytes (python -m agent4 verify).
# Git must never rewrite their line endings, or a Linux checkout / Docker build would fail the check.
# This rule must stay AFTER the rules above: when attributes conflict, the last matching line wins.
models/** -text
